# Execution and product rules

`board/state.json` is the only task source of truth. Generated files (`EXECUTION_BOARD.md`, `docs/status.md`, `docs/to-do.md`, `docs/skill-registry.md`, `board/execution-board.html`) must be regenerated with `npm run board`, not edited by hand.

Before substantial work, read `EXECUTION_BOARD.md` and the skill under `skills/` that matches the task. Canonical skills are edited in `skills/` only.

Money is integer minor units. Do not invent statutory payroll formulas (DEC-004). Do not commit `.env` or present mock pay as real data. A task is not done without a passing test record.

Continue the next unblocked task when the current one is finished. Ask the user only for a missing secret, a destructive approval, or a business rule that cannot be inferred safely.
